  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When D grade talents are eliminated from battle work, narration notes that their limited talent led them to choose support-type Gu worms for production line or transport work suited to their lives, with little help in battles.",
      "chapters": [
        82
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kong Jing is a logistics support Gu Master who controls Large Belly Frog. That frog is a support Gu worm whose belly holds another space usable as storage.",
      "chapters": [
        88
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "storage-support-worm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan lists a support-type Gu such as the Liquor worm among ways a C grade talent can help break the rank one wall toward rank two, beside talent-raising Gu and external primeval essence from a higher-ranking Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        91
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "barrier-aid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_liquor_worm",
        "sys_c_grade"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To make a Gu set around a core such as all-out effort Gu, one core is not enough. Several important support Gu must be chosen carefully, or the set cannot display the core’s full value.",
      "chapters": [
        286
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "set-complements",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_all_out_effort_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu as living tools are covered on Gu worms. Storage as a separate classification is covered on Storage Gu.",
